  "notes": "Review of the salesmen's commissions (AR_COMM_PAY / AR_COMM_SALES / AR_COMM_AGES written by GET_SALESMAN_COMM): calculate and delete a month, adjust the commission percent / value; the generated grid on AR_SALESMAN_COMM was corrected; rules in APP_RULES3_AR.",
  "rules": {
    "where": "(nvl(to_number(:G_PASSWORD_NUMBER), 0) = 0 or CODE in (select SALESMAN_CODE from AR_SALESMAN_PASSWORD where PASSWORD_NUMBER = to_number(:G_PASSWORD_NUMBER)))",
